      "created_at": "2022-06-23T18:50:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-06-23T18:50:18Z",
      "body": "Hi @iman-jamali-fw. After discussing with the team, we have decided to go ahead and remove the forms tab for both Clients and Reviewers. \n\nClients will only be able to come to formsflow using the direct link to the form. No tabs in the formsflow tool will be available to them. After clicking submit, the clients will be taken to a confirmation window/page (this can be in cms lite/myhr as a redirect)\n\nFor reviewers, only the tasks tab will be available for them to come into formsflow and approve/deny an application that was specifically assigned to them.\n\nAplogies for the back and forth on this. ",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
