      "body": "Hi @david-sabadash \nOur understanding of the business requirements is that users after submitting a form will be redirected to a confirmation page, either within formsflow or a redirect to a page in CMS Lite. \n\nNew users coming into Formsflow to make a submission will not have the link to the forms tab, instead only the direct link to the Telework Agreement form will be available to them to sign in and complete their submission. \n\nHope this helps!",
